// Paterdomus Temple
// Cache 786's map puts no organ on 289's smallchurchorgan spot (0_53_54_17_27)
// and places smallchurchorgan nowhere. The one Church organ in that map square
// is church_organ_30754 (op1 Play) at 0_53_54_22_38, which this port takes for
// the temple's (2011 wiki, Paterdomus, 2011-05-17: "The ground floor also has
// an intact church organ"). 289's music:com_177 is music_v3:com4 here, the
// component music/scripts/music.rs2 writes the playing song's name to.
[oploc1,church_organ_30754]
if(random(2) = 0) {
    midi_song("church music 1");
    if_settext(music_v3:com4, "");
} else {
    midi_song("church music 2");
    if_settext(music_v3:com4, "");
}
